*Episode 001 — The Quiet Guy Who Was Asked to Tell a Story*

**28 OCTOBER 2026 — WEDNESDAY**

*Genre: Absurd Cosmic Comedy × Music × Cartoon × Slice of Life × Love × Spiritual Reflection*

