## BORN TO RUNNING

### THE RIDDLE OF THE SILENT STORYTELLER

**THE BOY WHO PREFERRED SILENCE.**

**THE DREAM THAT CHALLENGED HIS HABITS.**

**THE LOVE THAT INSPIRED HIM TO TRY.**

